 "sentences": [
  {
   "role": "hook",
   "text": "If you dig a well in your yard, you have a deep hole."
  },
  {
   "role": "problem",
   "text": "But the water sits far below, out of reach."
  },
  {
   "role": "fix1",
   "text": "So you sink a pump and grow a pipe."
  },
  {
   "role": "problem2",
   "text": "But the pump slams, and a pipe joint bursts, spraying water everywhere."
  },
  {
   "role": "fix2",
   "text": "So you add a tank that catches the surge."
  },
  {
   "role": "problem3",
   "text": "But now, on the ground, the water only dribbles out of the spout."
  },
  {
   "role": "fix3",
   "text": "So you lift the tank onto tall legs and feed it with a riser."
  },
  {
   "role": "problem4",
   "text": "But the riser keeps pushing, and the full tank spills over the rim."
  },
  {
   "role": "fix4",
